Package: assignmentB2JorgeEduardoHernandezRodriguez
Title: Statistics and histogram distribution of a grouped numerical variable in a data set
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Jorge Eduardo", "Hernandez Rodriguez", , "jhernan1@student.ubc.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This function makes a table with the main descriptive statistics of a numerical variable in a data set grouped by a categorical variable. The user must input the titles of the categorical and numerical variables contained in their data set for the function to work. Furthermore this function creates a histogram of the distribution of the numerical variable grouped.
Imports: dplyr, 
         ggplot2,
         stats,
         rlang,
         testthat,
         palmerpenguins
